## Do not

- Duplicate step-gating logic in the UI component — call `currentGuidedStep()` and `guidedFlowPrerequisitesBlocking()`.
- Add a guided-flow-only action without an advanced mode counterpart (or vice versa).
- Skip score readiness checks — if the guided flow blocks at `prerequisites`, advanced mode must at least warn.
- Assume guided mode is always on — test both modes when changing dashboard layout or actions.
- Open a **week** template picker from guided **Change pick**, or put composites in single-day paint lists.
- Place the VIP step (or VIP actions) before lock.
- Suggest swap targets on or before server today, or hide Swap solely because it is the last day of the week.
